  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「機動戦士ガンダム SEED C.E.73 －STERGAZER－」に登場する“ケルベロスバクゥハウンド”がHGシリーズにラインナップ！",
      "en": "“Cerberus Bakuhound” appearing in “Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E.73 -STERGAZER-” is now available in the HG series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "背部に装備した“ケルベロス・ウィザード”は着脱式、他1/144キットのウィザードとの交換も可能。",
      "en": "The \"Cerberus Wizard\" equipped on the back is removable and can be replaced with other 1/144Kit Wizards."
    },
    {
      "ja": "足の付け根にはダブルボールジョイントを採用、広い可動範囲で劇中のポージングを再現可能。",
      "en": "Double ball joints are used at the base of the legs, allowing a wide range of motion to recreate the poses from the movie."
    },
    {
      "ja": "脚部のキャタピラは中心軸で可動し、脚部を折りたたんだ走行形態を再現可能。",
      "en": "The caterpillar legs move around the central axis, allowing you to recreate the running form with the legs folded."
    },
    {
      "ja": "各頭部に装着するビームサーベルはクリアパーツで再現。",
      "en": "The beam sabers attached to each head are reproduced with clear parts."
    }
  ],
